flowchart LR
    Visitor[Website Visitor]
    Frontend[Static Demo Frontend\nfrontend/index.html]
    Config[Frontend Config\nfrontend/config.js]
    Api[Amazon API Gateway\nHTTP API]
    Publisher[AWS Lambda\npublish_handler.py]
    Topic[Amazon SNS\nNotification Topic]
    Notifier[AWS Lambda\nnotify_handler.py]
    Queue[Amazon SQS\nLogger Queue]
    DLQ[Amazon SQS\nDead-Letter Queue]
    Logger[AWS Lambda\nlog_handler.py]
    Recent[AWS Lambda\nrecent_handler.py]
    Table[(Amazon DynamoDB\nDelivery Log + RecentIndex + TTL)]
    SES[Amazon SES]
    Inbox[Configured Recipient]
    Logs[Amazon CloudWatch Logs]
    IAM[AWS IAM\nScoped Service Permissions]

    Visitor --> Frontend
    Frontend --> Config
    Frontend -->|POST /notify| Api
    Api --> Publisher
    Publisher -->|Publish| Topic
    Topic -->|Direct Lambda subscription| Notifier
    Topic -->|SQS subscription| Queue
    Queue --> Logger
    Queue -. After repeated failures .-> DLQ
    Notifier -->|SendEmail| SES
    SES --> Inbox
    Notifier -->|Write notifier row| Table
    Logger -->|Write logger row| Table
    Frontend -->|GET /notify/recent| Api
    Api --> Recent
    Recent -->|Query RecentIndex| Table
    IAM --> Publisher
    IAM --> Notifier
    IAM --> Logger
    IAM --> Recent
    Publisher --> Logs
    Notifier --> Logs
    Logger --> Logs
    Recent --> Logs
